window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A cursed prince. A gifted scribe. A book that could break them—or free them.</b></p> <p>Isabella “Bella” Rinaldi has lost everything. All she carries into her new life is her gift for translating forgotten languages—and a mysterious, unreadable book.</p> <p>When she meets Prince Leopold, she discovers his secret: each full moon he transforms into a beast, trapped by a deadly curse. He believes Bella’s book may hold the key to his salvation.</p> <p>As Bella works to unravel its secrets, their bond deepens. But time is running out, and dark magic is closing in. Can she unlock the spell before the curse claims him forever?</p> <p><b>Narrated by the author. A lush Beauty and the Beast retelling for fans of Sarah J. Maas and Shelby Mahurin. Listen now and fall under the spell.</b></p>"; 
